<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetNextEmail(Address: string, Subject: string)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llGetNextEmail(string Address, string Subject);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Get the next queued <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Email" target="_blank">email</a> that comes from <b>address</b>, with specified <b>subject</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Address / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/address" target="_blank">address</a></td>
          <td>Sender's mail address</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Subject / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/subject" target="_blank">subject</a></td>
          <td>Mail subject</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>script_communication</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">120</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>If <b>address</b> or <b>subject</b> an empty string, then that parameter will be treated as a wildcard.</p>
  <h2>Specification</h2>
  <p>The <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Email" target="_blank">email</a> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Event" target="_blank">event</a> will be triggered only if <b>address</b> and <b>subject</b> match</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Neither parameter is case sensitive.</li>
    <li>If a parameter is an empty string, then that parameter will be treated as a wildcard, matches anything.</li>
    <li>If both parameters are empty strings then the first email in the queue will be matched.</li>
    <li>The email queue is FIFO.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

local function main()
    ll.OwnerSay("My email address is: " .. tostring(ll.GetKey()) .. "@lsl.secondlife.com")

    -- check every half minute
    ll.SetTimerEvent(30.0)
end

function LLEvents.timer()
    --Check for emails
    ll.GetNextEmail("", "")
end

function LLEvents.email(time, address, subj, message, num_left)
    ll.OwnerSay("I got an email: " .. subj .. "\n" .. message)
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        llOwnerSay("My email address is: " + (string)llGetKey() + "@lsl.secondlife.com");

        // check every half minute
        llSetTimerEvent(30.0);
    }
 
    timer()
    {
        //Check for emails
        llGetNextEmail("", "");
    }
 
    email(string time, string address, string subj, string message, integer num_left)
    {
          llOwnerSay("I got an email: " + subj + "\n" + message);
     }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
